# program: ../apps/window-designer/src/main.nx
# An empty design file is a new design. The empty window's preview says
# what to do; its program still builds (exported, then checked by cargo test).
file .local/share/window-designer/design.json 
file Documents/.keep 
window Window Designer
key F5
shot empty-preview
key ctrl+shift+F12
key F6
key ctrl+e
window Export the program
key Return
gone Export the program
window Window Designer
key ctrl+shift+F12
key Escape
show Documents/my-app.nx
show .local/share/window-designer/design.json
